      "sec_id": 74655019494466785563097583737764965597,
      "title": "Neural Operators",
      "raw_text": "Traditional neural networks learn mappings between finite-dimensional vectors. In contrast, many scientific problems require learning mappings between functions, known as operators . Neural operators enable direct learning of these function-to-function mappings.",
