          "sec_id": 284955934951374023438400731259577798182,
          "title": "Fourier Neural Operator (FNO)",
          "raw_text": "The Fourier Neural Operator is designed for efficiency and scalability. It operates in the fre- quency domain using Fourier transforms.\n• Resolution Invariance : Models trained on coarse grids generalize to finer grids.\n• Efficiency : Uses Fast Fourier Transforms (FFT), making it significantly faster than DeepONet for PDE problems.",
